
metadata:
  book_id: "musnad-imam-shafii"
  book_name: "Musnad Imam al-Shafi'i"
  total_hadiths: "1819"
  available_languages: "ar,bn,bs,de,en,es,fr,hi,id,roman-ur,ru,sw,ta,te,tr,ur"
  ai_translated_languages: "bn,bs,de,es,fr,hi,id,roman-ur,ru,sw,ta,te,tr"
  ai_translation_note: "The following languages are machine-assisted translations from the Arabic via LLM, disclosed per-row with an [AI-translation] prefix: bn,bs,de,es,fr,hi,id,roman-ur,ru,sw,ta,te,tr. All other languages are human/scholarly translations."
  intro: "The Musnad of Imam Muhammad ibn Idris al-Shafi'i (d. 204 AH), the founder of the Shafi'i school, gathers his narrations from the Prophet (peace be upon him) arranged by subject. Presented here in 1,819 hadith with Arabic, English and Urdu."
  intro_ar: "مسند الإمام محمد بن إدريس الشافعي (ت 204هـ)، مؤسس المذهب الشافعي، يجمع مروياته عن النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم مرتبة على الأبواب. يُعرض هنا في 1819 حديثا بالعربية والإنجليزية والأردية."
  intro_en: "The Musnad of Imam Muhammad ibn Idris al-Shafi'i (d. 204 AH), the founder of the Shafi'i school, gathers his narrations from the Prophet (peace be upon him) arranged by subject. Presented here in 1,819 hadith with Arabic, English and Urdu."
  intro_ur: "مسند امام محمد بن ادریس الشافعی (م 204ھ)، بانی مذہب شافعی، ان کی نبی کریم صلی اللہ علیہ وسلم سے مروی روایات کا ابواب پر مرتب مجموعہ ہے۔ یہاں 1819 احادیث عربی، انگریزی اور اردو کے ساتھ پیش ہیں۔"
  intro_bn: "The Musnad of Imam Muhammad ibn Idris al-Shafi'i (d. 204 AH), the founder of the Shafi'i school, gathers his narrations from the Prophet (peace be upon him) arranged by subject. Presented here in 1,819 hadith with Arabic, English and Urdu."
